Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:10:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/19] ggml : int8 (dp4a) multi-column Q8_0 verify GEMV

Quantize the 2..8 verify activation columns per 32-block and use packed int8 dots
against the flat Q8_0 weights (the float multi-column kernel is ALU-bound on the
248k-row LM head). Opt out with GGML_OPENCL_Q8_MC_DP4A=0.
X2-90 MTP N=5 p-min 0.6: 38.3/47.0 -> 39.5/47.8 tok/s; output coherent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
